; six_swiss built against the slim prelude (Zq-based, wasm-capable).
; The parallel six_swiss_js/ build against imandrax-api-prelude is kept so the
; two can be diffed for behavioural drift.
;
; (modes js) here because this repo's switch is still on js_of_ocaml 6.0.1;
; WASI needs 6.4.1 + dune 3.22+, where this becomes (modes wasm) plus
; (wasm_of_ocaml (flags --enable wasi)).

(executable
 (name six_swiss_wrapper)
 (modes js byte exe)
 ; Warnings disabled for machine-generated/extracted code:
 ;   32 - the codec set is emitted whole (json_of_int has no call site here,
 ;        since match_price returns a real option)
 ;   44 - `open Iml_prelude` shadows Stdlib's int/list/option/=/< on purpose;
 ;        that shadowing IS the prelude
 ;   70 - extracted modules ship without .mli
 (flags (:standard -w -4-32-44-70))
 (libraries iml_prelude))
